    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled within a mature and highly sought-after residential development, this attractive three-bedroom mid-terrace residence offers spacious, light-filled accommodation extending over two floors. Combining generous living space with a practical family layout, this superb home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, young families and those seeking a comfortable home in a convenient location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a bright and spacious living room positioned to the front of the property. This inviting reception room features a charming fireplace, timber flooring and a large picture window, creating a warm and relaxing space for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nTo the rear lies the heart of the home—a generous open-plan kitchen and dining area offering an excellent range of fitted wall and floor units, extensive worktop space and integrated cooking appliances. The dining area comfortably accommodates a family-sized table and benefits from double patio doors that open onto the private rear garden, seamlessly connecting indoor and outdoor living. A practical guest WC/utility room completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts three well-proportioned bedrooms, including two generous double bedrooms and a spacious single bedroom, each enjoying excellent natural light and ample space for modern family living. A well-appointed family bathroom is complemented by the added convenience of a separate shower room, making busy mornings effortless.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside, the enclosed rear garden provides a private and secure outdoor retreat, laid mainly in lawn with a patio area and timber garden shed, offering an ideal setting for entertaining, children's play or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\n\r\nPresented in neutral décor throughout, this wonderful home has been well maintained and offers purchasers the opportunity to move straight in while adding their own personal touches over time."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nA bright and welcoming entrance hall sets the tone for the home, featuring attractive timber flooring and providing access to the principal ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nLocated to the front of the property, this generously proportioned reception room is flooded with natural light from a large picture window. A feature fireplace creates an attractive focal point, while the warm timber flooring and neutral décor provide a comfortable and inviting setting. Offering ample space for a range of seating arrangements, this is an ideal room for both relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nStretching across the rear of the property, the spacious open-plan kitchen and dining room forms the heart of the home. The kitchen is fitted with an excellent selection of contemporary wall and floor units, generous worktop space and integrated oven, gas hob and extractor fan, together with space for additional appliances.\r\n\r\nThe dining area comfortably accommodates a family-sized dining table and enjoys an abundance of natural light from the full-width patio doors, which open directly onto the rear garden. This versatile space is perfectly suited to everyday family living and entertaining alike.\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room / Guest WC\r\nConveniently located off the kitchen, the utility room provides additional worktop space, plumbing for laundry appliances and houses the gas-fired central heating boiler. A guest WC and wash hand basin complete this practical space.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nA bright landing provides access to all bedrooms and the family bathroom, with a hot press offering additional storage.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\nPositioned to the front of the property, the principal bedroom is a spacious double room featuring a large window overlooking the front aspect. The room offers excellent floor space for a double bed together with wardrobes and additional bedroom furniture, creating a bright and comfortable retreat.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\nAn additional shower room fitted with a fully enclosed shower cubicle and wash hand basin provides excellent convenience for family living.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\nA generous rear-facing double bedroom enjoying pleasant views over the rear garden. This well-proportioned room provides ample space for wardrobes and storage, making it ideal as a guest room or children's bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\nA bright and versatile single bedroom that would equally lend itself to use as a nursery, home office or study. A large window ensures excellent natural light throughout the day.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nThe family bathroom is fitted with a white three-piece suite comprising a bath with shower attachment, WC and wash hand basin. A frosted window provides both natural light and ventilation.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront\r\nThe property enjoys an attractive brick façade with a low-maintenance front garden and pedestrian access, creating an appealing first impression.\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nTo the rear lies a private enclosed garden, predominantly laid in lawn with a paved patio area immediately outside the kitchen, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining. A timber garden shed provides useful external storage, while mature planting enhances privacy and creates an enjoyable outdoor space for families."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n\r\nAttractive three-bedroom mid-terrace residence\r\nBright and spacious accommodation throughout\r\nLarge living room with feature fireplace\r\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining area with patio doors to rear garden\r\nGuest WC with utility area\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nDouble-glazed windows\r\nB3 BER – energy-efficient home\r\nMay qualify for Green Mortgage products (subject to lender approval)\r\nEnclosed rear garden with patio and garden shed\r\nConvenient location close to schools, shops and local amenities"
      },
      {
